out.push(S('Stage 7R · Share'));
out.push(A('One student reads their finding without the refusal and the room concludes; then with it, and the room concludes again. ⚠ **The second answer should be the finding, word for word.** **Where it is not, the refusal has named the wrong step**, and the useful question is which step it named instead — **in most cases a smaller one that nobody was going to take.** **Then Mr Zahreddine\'s arithmetic to end on.**'));
