out.push(S('Stage 7R · Share'));
out.push(A('One student reads their limit at the speed of the sentence before it and then slowly. ⚠ **The room says which version it would ask about: the slow one.** **A limit read slowly has been marked by its writer as the difficult part**, and in a viva, a hearing or a registration interview the reader goes to whatever the writer marked. **Then Mrs Tarabishi\'s sentence to end on: the worse the limit, the earlier it belongs.**'));
out.push(S('Homework (sample)'));
